Package: nhanesGraph
Title: Graphical tools for NHANES data
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Minjee", "Kim", 
    email = "minjeekim0804@tamu.edu", 
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2001-2442"))
Description: Search and download public-use continuous NHANES files, and plot a variable. Loads the current CDC XPT files (1999-2000 through August 2021-August 2023, including the 2017-2020 pre-pandemic release) instead of the retired RNHANES download URLs.
